  triage:description "The sprint owns paths in sc-agent-types, sc-agent-http, sc-decision-schema, sc-jev-check, sc-jev-host, sc-ai and sc-jev-py. The requirements list names only some of each crate's ids. Missing ids include REQ-SAG-0101, 0103, 0120, 0121, 0147, 0148, 0505, 0140-0145 (partial), 0300-0314 (partial), 0503, 0601-0605, 0702, 0703, 0710, 0712, 0803 and others. Every id a sprint's files touch must be in its requirements list; ids that are not req: roots also need a regression command in the boundary row." ;
